{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/3f306807f89ca138b05495c014592723.avif?t=1768927221\" width=241 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e0eb667136c84373294c9a6f001fcc3a.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e0eb667136c84373294c9a6f001fcc3a.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e0eb667136c84373294c9a6f001fcc3a.mp4?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op PVE experience play with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>The darkness has awakened. And fear is your enemy.</strong><br>When ancient rituals disturbed the balance of the world, humanity faced a horror it could never foresee. Demons broke loose. The ground split open. Cities were swallowed by the abyss. But alongside the chaos, ancient crystals emerged \u2014 capable of sealing the portals to the demonic realm.<br>You are one of the few sent into the heart of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/80676d38ea59310d6eaf740d1401eea8.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/80676d38ea59310d6eaf740d1401eea8.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/80676d38ea59310d6eaf740d1401eea8.mp4?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/4bcfb58cd56d9147a5d8c720c0705f07.avif?t=1768927221\" width=241 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Atmospheric horror in a dark fantasy world</strong><br>Abandoned villages, blood-soaked altars, fire seeping through the earth \u2014 every step is steeped in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Survival with minimal resources</strong><br>Only spells, potions, and artifacts. No weapons. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/7f5f9287b0691f62570f3067820d6c5c.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/7f5f9287b0691f62570f3067820d6c5c.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/7f5f9287b0691f62570f3067820d6c5c.mp4?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>Fear system</strong><br>The more afraid you are, the more visible you become to the darkness. Monsters sense it. Hunt it. Feed on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/0fe7d1456708010e3f55857266d23121.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/0fe7d1456708010e3f55857266d23121.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/0fe7d1456708010e3f55857266d23121.mp4?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Character progression</strong><br>Develop skills, manage fear, unlock rare abilities, and adapt to survive and complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Rituals &amp; Bosses</strong><br>Find ritual items, bring them to the altar, summon the boss, and use crystal powers to defeat it. Earn boss crystals as trophies for your personal lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e6d9d0a85999b75b29bef515bf972045.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e6d9d0a85999b75b29bef515bf972045.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e6d9d0a85999b75b29bef515bf972045.mp4?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/f5d1554197e5e15ff6fdec8e05236724.webp?t=1768927221\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>You're not fighting evil. You're fighting yourself.</strong><br><i>Pilgrim of Darkness</i> isn\u2019t just about demons.<br>It\u2019s about the fear that grows inside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/80676d38ea59310d6eaf740d1401eea8.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/80676d38ea59310d6eaf740d1401eea8.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/80676d38ea59310d6eaf740d1401eea8.mp4?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather the crystals. Perform the rituals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/0636c0507c9e32b54f22374fa8c1115b.avif?t=1768927221\" width=75 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Before the darkness finds you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712230?t=1768927221","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/3bc4fc1019da5792e34def3796d087702e412ae4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768927221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/f05ef5ac5570844f5bd6e7da5a17a4475a9d1c2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768927221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/f05ef5ac5570844f5bd6e7da5a17a4475a9d1c2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768927221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4100220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/3f306807f89ca138b05495c014592723.avif?t=1768927221\" width=241 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e0eb667136c84373294c9a6f001fcc3a.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712230/extras/e0eb667136c84373294c9a6f001fcc3a.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; co